# Build context = repo root (the gateway Dockerfile lives under deploy/gateway).
# The gateway image only needs the loom + flows Python packages (+ pyproject /
# README). Exclude everything heavy or irrelevant so the context stays small and
# the build stays fast — most importantly the multi-GB venv and the Node CLI.
.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.git/
.git
# the Node CLI, the docs/website, and the example/tutorial beds are not part of
# the gateway service image.
cli/
examples/
tutorials/
docs/
deploy/gateway/.env
.pytest_cache/
.env.metaflow
*.log
.DS_Store
